<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">{!Contact.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">I've got a really solid&nbsp;{!Project_List__c.Market__c} property about to come out and I wanted to tell you about it before the numbers are released on the property evaluation.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">The address is&nbsp;{!Assessment__c.Name} &nbsp;in {!Assessment__c.City__c} and the expected price will be&nbsp;{!Assessment__c.Asking_Price__c}. The worst case scenario appraisal will be right around&nbsp;{!Assessment__c.ARV_Low_End__c}.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="">We are spending&nbsp;{!Assessment__c.Rehab_Budget__c} on this one, so it will be a high performing asset for you for a very long time.<br><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style=""><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial, sans-serif;">I'll be working late tonight, so call/text me on my cell at </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">901-481-6842</span><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: arial, sans-serif;"> as late as you like.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thanks,<br><br>Marq<br clear="all"><div style=""><br></div>--&nbsp;<br><div class="m_-5778871205445602737gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="font-size: 12.8px;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-size: small; font-family: georgia,